<title>SPAIN: Spain 1-yr T-bill yield falls to 6.954 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 1-yr T-bill yield falls to 6.954 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the</p>
<p>following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid,</p>
<p>allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>1-year     6.954   7.147    93.430  93.26    1,153     828.2</p>
</text>
